RGND2N 2N 0 1e12
.ENDS


* ctrl = UE/UEN=1+stproz/100 (0.9 .. 1 .. 1.2)
.subckt Trafo3Yy0_simple_ctrl  1U  1V  1W  1N  2U  2V  2W  2N ctrl
